    "Description": "This package provides build-stage rpm automation to simplify the creation of Go language (golang) packages.  It does not need to be included in the default build root: go-srpm-macros will pull it in for Go packages only.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* golang: net/url: Memory exhaustion in query parameter parsing in net/url (CVE-2025-61726)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
